{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And if you reject My statutes.</b> He rejects others who do them." "<b>My ordinances — your soul loathes.</b> He hates the sages." "<b>So as not to do.</b> He prevents others from doing." "<b>All My commandments.</b> He denies that I commanded them — therefore it says ״אֶת כָּל מִצְוֹתַי״ and not ״אֶת כָּל הַמִּצְוֺת״." "<b>To break My covenant.</b> He denies the fundamental principle. Behold seven transgressions: the first drags the second, and so on to the seventh, and they are: he did not learn, and he did not do, he rejects others who do, he hates the sages, he prevents others, he denies the commandments, he denies the fundamental principle."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:38.906440964Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}